{"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"@property","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" (","kind":"text"},{"text":"nonatomic","kind":"keyword"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"NSExpression","preciseIdentifier":"c:objc(cs)NSExpression","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"kind":"text","text":" * "},{"text":"symbolPlacement","kind":"identifier"},{"kind":"text","text":";"}],"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"],"languages":["occ"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Discussion","type":"heading","anchor":"discussion","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The default value of this property is an expression that evaluates to ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"point"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Set this property to "},{"code":"nil","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" to reset it to the default value.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"You can set this property to an expression containing any of the following:"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Constant ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MLNSymbolPlacement"},{"text":" values","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Any of the following constant string values:","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"point"},{"text":": The label is placed at the point where the geometry is located.","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"line"},{"type":"text","text":": The label is placed along the line of the geometry. Can only be"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"used on "},{"code":"LineString","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Polygon"},{"type":"text","text":" geometries."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"line-center"},{"type":"text","text":": The label is placed at the center of the line of the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"geometry. Can only be used on "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"LineString"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Polygon"},{"text":" geometries. Note that","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"a single feature in a vector tile may contain multiple line geometries.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Predefined functions, including mathematical and string operators","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Conditional expressions","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Variable assignments and references to assigned variables","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Step functions applied to the ","type":"text"},{"code":"$zoomLevel","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" variable","type":"text"}]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This property does not support applying interpolation functions to the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"$zoomLevel"},{"type":"text","text":" variable or applying interpolation or step functions to feature"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"attributes."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"kind":"symbol","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre","doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNSymbolStyleLayer"]]},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"occ","url":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNSymbolStyleLayer\/symbolPlacement"},"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Instance Property","title":"symbolPlacement","modules":[{"name":"MapLibre"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"symbolPlacement","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","symbolKind":"property","fragments":[{"text":"symbolPlacement","kind":"identifier"}],"externalID":"c:objc(cs)MLNSymbolStyleLayer(py)symbolPlacement"},"abstract":[{"text":"Label placement relative to its geometry.","type":"text"}],"sections":[],"variants":[{"paths":["\